-#
-#  The statement of one finance account. TWO kinds of account share this page
-#  and it branches on exactly the marker WsjrdpFinAccount#transactions branches
-#  on (Fin::WsjrdpFinAccountsController#moss_wallet? --
-#  transaction_type == "MossBalanceMovement"):
-#
-#    * the Moss WALLET -> _moss_wallet: the expandable table with the kind
-#      chips, the filter and its four kind presets;
-#    * every BANK account -> _camt_statement: the plain camt table, unchanged.
-#
-#  Both end with the account's own form (_account_form).
- if moss_wallet?
  = render "fin/wsjrdp_fin_accounts/moss_wallet"
- else
  = render "fin/wsjrdp_fin_accounts/camt_statement"
